<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>21 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>19 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>13 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Oli Alvarez (Oviedo),</p>
<p>Alfonso Perez (Betis),</p>
<p>12 - Luis Enrique Martinez (Barcelona), Rivaldo (Deportivo</p>
<p>Coruna), Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid), Raul Gonzalez (Real</p>
<p>Madrid)</p>
<p>11 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Juan Eduardo Esnaider</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid), Christopher Ohen (Compostela), Victor</p>
<p>Fernandez (Valladolid), Corentin Martins (Deportivo Coruna)</p>
<p>10 - Salva Ballesta (Sevilla)</p>
<p>9 - Ismael Urzaiz (Athletic Bilbao), Kiko Narvaez (Atletico</p>
<p>Madrid), Finidi George (Betis)</p>
